fhe() evaluation time (dense case, median): 87.72 ms
CKKS levels consumed: 1
CHEHAB depth (total, multiplicative): (3, 1); IR terms: 14
operations: ct_ct_mul=0, ct_pt_mul=3, relin=0, rotate=3, rescale=3, mod_switch=0, match_scale=0, add=1
max abs error vs expected: 1.14e-05

You have 8 attempts. Propose a faster kernel that computes the same outputs.

